# rpmlint filters. Each one states why the finding cannot be satisfied.

# The words are a file name extension (the tcc-guard configuration file
# /etc/asus-ux8406-tcc-guard.toml) and a package name
# (asus-zenbook-duo-ux8406-keyboard-bpf); neither can be spelled differently,
# and the descriptions need both to tell the reader what to configure or install.
addFilter(r"spelling-error .*'(toml|bpf)'")
